WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.140
Let's play!

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:33.960
There is a good tune!

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.140
It was the edge

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.960
And the edge of the table

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:04.800
I beat Miikka with a bongo!

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:06.580
Maybe I should start playing with this one

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.880
This is a masterpiece by me and Emil

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.160
What a beat!

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:39.640
It's not the fastest racket but it's
it's a nice-sounding racket!

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.560
This is the only instrument I know how to play!

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:49.500
This is quite fun actually!

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:57.200
Oh! Didn't see you there!

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.320
Such a relaxing sound.

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:02.120
This should be fun!

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.380
It's like ASMR

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.720
Ping Pong ASMR

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.860
Okay, this is mine and Emil's song

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:48.400
Like a bedtime song!

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.020
Yeah!

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:54.700
Do you recognize this song?

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:56.520
Yeah, it's the one...

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:58.000
It's the one called...

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.900
"Don't forget subscribe to Pongfinity"

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:01.720
Indeed!

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:03.240
Don't forget to subscribe!

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.600
Yes, that's the one.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.220
Musical smashes

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.220
Is that an actual song?

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.960
I don't know!

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:00.860
New way to play guitar!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.080
This is how every guitar player should practise!

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:40.840
Sorry

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:52.700
Amost!

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:57.000
Next up: a cowbell

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.260
I really like this cowbell

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:22.620
Wow

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:24.960
Wow

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.140
Okay the cowbell serve

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.140
Come on!

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:34.800
Drop!

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.140
Hello bell!

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:43.520
I like the sound

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:45.960
Let's try these out!

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:20.240
Okay I have no idea how to play this
thing

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:22.260
but maybe I can play with this thing

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:45.120
Couldn't get the short one

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:57.820
Miikka and Otto

00:07:57.820 --> 00:07:59.100
The world-famous duo

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:01.440
Would you guys listen to mine and Otto's music?

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:02.820
Sounds good.

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:04.900
Okay let's try and lift this thing up

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:09.200
This thing is bigger than me!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:10.720
This is so heavy!

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.960
Otto, you come and do this challenge!

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:29.520
So safe!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.040
Otto is giving me forehand footwork!

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:43.240
Sorry, too short

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:48.520
Nice save

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:53.620
That's a good exercise

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:55.180
It's quite easy to play with it

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:56.200
But it's a bit heavy

00:08:56.340 --> 00:09:01.100
Remember to subscribe to Pongfinity

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:05.120
We had so much fun filming this episode today

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:08.520
Big thanks to the band members of Tuure Kilpeläinen ja Kaihon Karavaani

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:11.380
For borrowing us these amazing instruments!

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:29.300
It sounds like a song actually!

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:33.580
Miikka even looks like he knows what he is doing!

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:53.940
I would give you money if you would
be on the street playing this!

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:54.840
Thanks!

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:57.060
Remember to subscribe to our channel here

00:09:57.060 --> 00:09:59.140
